Short:        Load IFF files & permit to print it . Support AGA
Author:       licgin@relay.income.it (Giambattista Bloisi)
Uploader:     licgin relay income it (Giambattista Bloisi)
Type:         dev/src
Version:      V1.2
Requires:     OS 2.0 or later. OCS & AGA are supported
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This simple program show you how to use ILBM modules
to load a picture file, display it in a custom
screen and how to handle a very simple menu
to entually print the picture file.

Public Domain.
